<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Petrobras to launch Level One ADR by Dec.</title>
<headline>Brazil Petrobras to launch Level One ADR by Dec.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's state oil monopoly Petrobras will launch a Level One ADR by the end of December, its first ever ADR, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;We still haven't set a time, but it will happen by the end of December,&quot; said the spokeswoman, who requested anonymity.</p>
<p>The amount of the ADR issue would depend on market demand, she said.</p>
<p>-- John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 232-4411</p>
</text>
